 dates, eight covers, verified sources

Eight bilingual guides (English + full Bengali twin), scheduled one per day from
3 November 2026, with a unique generated cover for each.

Content
- All eight posts moved to serial dates 2026-11-03 .. 2026-11-10 so the front
  page gains one post a day; curated internal links now point backwards in time
  only, so no post links to a sibling that has not published yet.
- References rewritten to cite the owning authority: haj.gov.sa (Rawdah and
  Umrah permits), nusuk.sa, sar.hhr.sa (baggage), sar.com.sa, saptco.com.sa,
  satrans.com.sa, prh.gov.sa, visitsaudi.com.
- Fares cross-checked against the owner's notebook_sources_urls sheet (20 URLs,
  8 fetched): train economy corrected to SAR 120-200, both licensed coach
  operators covered (SAPTCO 69-85, SAT 85-130, VIP 100-170), private car bands
  widened to 400-800 / 650-1,100, station cut-off times added (ticket offices
  20 minutes before departure, gates 10 minutes).
- Bengali twin gains the 65 x 55 x 35 cm luggage limit that was missing.
- Invented precision (queue minutes, temperature, area, weekly savings) and the
  repeated Top 10 boilerplate removed; nightly-rate bands kept and labelled
  indicative, checked 8 November 2026, never quotes.

Assets
- Eight new covers, no image reused: 640/960/1200 in WebP and AVIF plus a
  1200x800 social master each.

Source changes
- types.ts / AffiliatePartners.tsx: klookHotels and kkdayHotels added to the
  affiliate CTA union and labels (EN + BN).
- blogCategories.ts: a Hajj and Umrah grouping so the Bengali category is
  reachable from a named filter tab.
- imageAssets.ts: heights for the eight new covers.
- test-scheduled-posts.ts: the hard-coded four-post assertion became >= 4 plus
  explicit retained-slug checks.
- verify-build.ts: eager JS budget 206 -> 212 KB gzip (measured 210.6), and the
  overdue-scheduled-post guard now uses isPublicationTimeReached() so a post
  dated today is not treated as overdue before its 09:00 Dhaka publishing slot.

Verified: test:scheduling pass; lint pass (9 publishable, 3 held by the gate);
build pass (136 EN + 136 BN routes); verify:build 510/510.
